# Context Session Economy

Cross-cutting. Layer 0: @.cursor/rules/token-economy-core.mdc

## 1. Session unit

**One chat = one atomic subtask** with clear AC.

| Scope | Own chat? |
|-------|-----------|
| Single file / L1 typo | same chat OK |
| IMPLEMENT → QA · PLAN → IMPLEMENT · role switch | **new chat** |

## 2. New chat — recommend when

AC met · next substep differs · role switch · long debug trace · user confusion.  
**Не требовать** для: checkbox в том же subtask; тот же bug в fresh context.

## 3. Session start

1. `activeContext.md` → `load_now` only (PLAN: inventory per workflow-plan)
2. **§Handoff** — единственный канон навигации
3. Не опираться на transcript
4. ONE task shard + ONE plan shard (shard, not index)
5. Skills: только для subtask

**PLAN:** Load ≠ Write — plan output unlimited (§0.0).

## 4. During session

Read once per file · parent MAY spawn for wide work · index = link only · isolation level из task.

## 5. FINISH

`finish-block.mdc` → шаблон `finish-doc-router.md` → routing `finish-doc-router.mdc`.

## 6. User message (RU)

New chat: текст из `finish-doc-router.md` §«Сообщение пользователю».

## 7. QA lean load

`load_now` + ONE shard + diff + §0.11 grep. Skip plan если AC ясен. Skip explore/recall. Parent гоняет suite из handoff.

## 8. TASK / BUGFIX

`load_now` first; core roots — только cross-cutting.

## 9. Forbidden

`done — do NOT load` · plan prose в shard/chat · completed substep в `load_now` · over-refusal spawn · trivial-only skip spawn
